Changes relative to the upstream project (v1.0.9 base):

- Added HDR badge (DV / HDR10+ / HDR10 / HLG / HDR) resolved from the best
  VideoRangeType/VideoRange across an item's video streams.
- Added community-rating badge (star + one-decimal rating).
- Audio badge changed to a compact best-stream label:
  Atmos / DTS:X / TrueHD / DTS-HD.
- Series posters: episode media streams are aggregated (via ILibraryManager,
  capped at 100 episodes, 6 h in-memory cache) so series show best-available
  quality badges; upstream showed no badges on series.
- Badging restricted to Movie / Episode / Series items.
- Restyled badges (DarkFlux): top-right pill stack, solid teal resolution
  pill, dark translucent pills with teal border, amber rating; new
  configuration fields (EnableHdrBadge, EnableRatingBadge, AccentColor,
  ResolutionTextColor, RatingColor); defaults TopRight / Primary only.
- New plugin identity (name, GUID, assembly name) so the fork never clashes
  with the original plugin.
